# Implementation Plan — Centralized Merchant Scope Resolver (Phase R2)

This plan details the centralization of the `resolveMerchantScope` security helper to eliminate duplicate logic and enforce consistent authorization across NestJS services.

## Proposed Changes

We will centralize the scope resolver logic inside `ScopeResolverService` and refactor all six services to use it.

